{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And he — a wife in her virginity</b> — והוא עולה י\"ח (and he rises to 18): allusion to eighteen years of age for the wedding canopy. And likewise: והוא כחתן יוצא מחופתו. בבתוליה — bet and yod are extra, since it could have been written בתולה. Allusion: until twelve years her virginity is complete."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:12.959093837Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}